<Layout title="The Hidden Cost of Inventory Holding (And How AI Reduces It) | PresciaIQ Insights"
  description="Carrying excess stock ties up capital. How predictive demand forecasting allows Australian businesses to run leaner inventory without stockouts.">
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <a href="/insights" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-8 font-sans">
